  "version": 1,
  "tree": {
    "id": "S65zIuLw",
    "name": "Rates went up (example)",
    "rootNodeId": "scTC6Q-gL8",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "scTC6Q-gL8",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "The rates for electricity have increased making it hard to make ends meet, what can I do?",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 120,
      "isRoot": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "rvx_rnffi9",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Step 0, always first: Do you have a disconnection notice, is your power already off, or does anyone in your home use medical equipment that needs electricity?",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 120,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "eufFqZxtvr",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Urgent path. Dominion Energy 866-366-4357 for a payment plan. 2-1-1 Virginia, dial 2-1-1, 24/7. Medical equipment form: demedical@domenergy.com",
      "width": 240,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": -420,
      "y": 440
    },
    {
      "id": "QdAIOqOT2V",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Screener, one at a time: Dominion or NOVEC? How many people in your home? Total monthly income before taxes? Electric heat or other? Behind on the bill, how much? Anyone 60+, 5 or under, disabled, or a veteran? Own or rent?",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 440
    },
    {
      "id": "5PHGhmbnRI",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Is household income at or under 150% of the federal poverty level? (1 person $1,956/mo, 4 people $4,018/mo, state manual 05/25) https://www.dss.virginia.gov/relief/ea/",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 130,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 680
    },
    {
      "id": "9xDBdropU2",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch A: Breathing room from Dominion (any income). Payment plan up to 6 months, Budget Billing. Call 866-366-4357 or dominionenergy.com",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "CZspk9f3KZ",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch B1: PIPP. Pay 10% of income (electric heat) or 6% (other). Apply at commonhelp.virginia.gov. Fairfax DFS 703-324-7500",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "jMSWw3HwzQ",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch B2: Virginia Energy Assistance (Fuel opens Oct 13 to Nov 13, Crisis Nov 1 to mid-March, Cooling Jun 15 to Aug 17). commonhelp.virginia.gov or 833-522-5582",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": -200,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "rIj5g1OTcH",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch C: EnergyShare (no income limit, need disconnection notice or similar). Heating up to $600, Cooling up to $300. Call 2-1-1 or United Community 703-768-7106",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "LNB8gwfmI_",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch D: Local help near 22310. Coordinated Services Planning 703-222-0880. Koinonia 703-971-1991",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "7phpqocxjC",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Branch E: Use less electricity. Weatherization via CHP 888-229-3714. https://www.dhcd.virginia.gov",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 900
    },
    {
      "id": "9hF5qgCe8Y",
      "treeId": "S65zIuLw",
      "text": "Nothing matched? Dominion 866-366-4357, CSP 703-222-0880, 2-1-1 Virginia. Fuel Assistance opens Oct 13, 2026.",
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "isRoot": false,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:00:20.827Z",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 900
    }
  ],
